{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "7e989cc3f7e202f8604fff000c321347fad6d9bd65a2ebea5cd55a5106440cb7", "ja": "未来を夢見て", "zh": "梦想着未来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "45e2ed9d00a1b7a48f8cea72fce2db3bfd78487903eb5bbaab03cc4e12f59d65", "ja": "公演終了後。翼は美希にバックダンサーを\n再度志願するが、はぐらかされてしまう。\n一方でジュリアは自分の夢に目を向け始めて\nいた。そして翼、ジュリア、瑞希はそれぞれ\nの想いを胸に、新たなステージへと向かう。", "zh": "公演结束后，翼再次向美希请求担任伴舞，却被她含糊地敷衍了过去。\n另一方面，茱莉亚也开始将目光投向自己的梦想。\n而翼、茱莉亚和瑞希各自怀揣着心愿，迈向新的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1000_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e3c16143474c7e3543729b52929b83c163abcaa8d2cae5c02bd82bf4ed9e4652", "ja": "美希センパーイ！　先輩！", "zh": "美希前辈——！前辈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9cc9d4b2fc0f65f7b34408968805d3db2e2413dbdb3c7e9c71fa1754d7b88817", "ja": "ねえねえ！　わたしのステージ、見ててくれました？\nけっこう良かったって思うんですけど！", "zh": "呐呐！你有看我的舞台表演吗？\n我觉得表现得还挺不错的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "0c921c3050195423438b626b322ab0e7b6c97ca991dfa9c0056d659e96773606", "ja": "ミキも良かったって思うよ。", "zh": "美希也觉得挺不错的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "09ece17d6830ef2a54e3e04e8f2e23cab37736eb0e5e4a330fded1c5c6ef4a9d", "ja": "本当に！？　だったらツアー連れてってもらえます？", "zh": "真的吗！？那样的话，可以带我一起去巡演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "9cfee4900de7f34ee855a2e83cbc02d94624246db6504f183c2908951e75ee00", "ja": "それはダメ。新曲は良かったけど、\nその後のコーラス、すっごく酷かったの。", "zh": "不行哦。新歌倒是不错，可是之后的合唱，实在是糟透了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "f3378f231ea4b44dc28199c7555bf3270f87915d64d15e1de359c97c2f57c150", "ja": "あのコーラスがカンペキに歌えるようになったら。\nその時はミキのダンサーにしてあげてもいいかな？", "zh": "等能把那个和声唱得完美无缺了。\n到那时美希再考虑让你当伴舞，好不好呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "dba9691e34bc5eb9d2cd7277947d4d40bc0af950bed34736d19d45d1faea229a", "ja": "？　……コーラス？　でもそれって、\nバックダンサーとは関係ないって思うんですけど。", "zh": "？……合唱？可是我觉得那和伴舞没什么关系吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5363f9f828aac2a443d5a81ff8750a1b5fc5b7799c06275908800e494e9a3a70", "ja": "ねえってばー、美希センパーイ。\n聞いてますー？　センパ……、！", "zh": "我说——美希前辈。\n你有在听吗——？前辈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "9440b60825b7ae2dbd264a16e27a436f67f120a838fb1168dc05f84b670df083", "ja": "翼がもうちょっとオトナになったら、\nきっと分かるよ。", "zh": "等翼再成熟一点，她肯定就会明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1010_406gsp", "source_sha256": "bf62359c1a5bf1c1629f475ba64bd88c8dba362bb3fdc4a9b4f4e2c13791884c", "ja": "ジュリア。お疲れ。\n少し寝たらどうだ？　昨日は徹夜だったんだろ？", "zh": "茱莉亚，辛苦了。\n睡一会儿怎么样？　你昨晚通宵了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "ab32d58dc762c893e2d05dba53f24b23e35602686c1af6adeae083cc1e80320f", "ja": "まあな。何より、あの翼の相手を\n二日間、付きっきりだぜ？　ヘトヘトだよ。", "zh": "是啊。更何况还得连续两天陪着翼那家伙？我都累得筋疲力尽了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "57f1bb0e418aa9e95a123fe0226d2c6e23092ff362df98e08f7f63b2c9f3c266", "ja": "……。プロデューサーがどんな理由であたしと翼を\n組ませたかは聞かないけど。", "zh": "……。虽然我不会问制作人你是出于什么理由\n才把我和翼分在一组的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "1ed41d43a7772f83bbde56dcffc28cb72334fec06d09f0b0c42e79daa0747208", "ja": "流石のあんたも、\n今回ばかりは目論見が外れたんじゃないか？", "zh": "就连你这次也没料到会是这种结果吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1014_406gsp", "source_sha256": "da3fd37ff20095aea309a89863f98698fd6c25664ef3c382461762fd629e085d", "ja": "……そうだな。", "zh": "……也是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "bfa186bbc1f85d8c6c755a229e8a61cc8bb73316976ee70b96d72ded8d09654b", "ja": "大人の真似も悪くないけど。そろそろ目ぇ見開いて\n新しい夢でも追ってみるかな。", "zh": "模仿大人也不赖，不过差不多也该睁大眼睛，\n去追寻新的梦想了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1016_406gsp", "source_sha256": "5cf2a695ebde4fc29b24009de5282fc93badcc18684fe018ff3d3f54b8485293", "ja": "？　ジュリア。それって……。", "zh": "？　茱莉亚。那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1017_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e785854574fd1a71e51c24621e9281ae86caccfd5acfc504011d3610da0d97f5", "ja": "プーローデューサーさん！", "zh": "制作人先生——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1019_se", "source_sha256": "c87d313ee534d741cb20b6a8ebc144b9270c4c5b5eeed687184a6cbde0457de3", "ja": "ドンッ！", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1020_406gsp", "source_sha256": "edca819f2a6c1ecedc93852e0e797255b428710911ca8ed5f9c4f86f2ce1891c", "ja": "うおっ！？　……翼、どうした？", "zh": "哇啊！？……翼，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0a62617684d596c3513af175a1f7731142f82644c1f6d929a6cb530ce278cf78", "ja": "プロデューサーさん！　お願いがあるんですけど。\nわたしのこと、早く大人にしてくださ～い。", "zh": "制作人！我有件事想拜托您。\n请快点让我长大成人吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "778c313602533ad1aa80e83e3532c140b4176948e8880080114676a3d44ae291", "ja": "！？　つ、つつ翼！\n何言ってんだおまえ！", "zh": "！？小、小小翼！\n你在说什么啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0412bfd9e34c3db7a5a4c9d9153049e2c3e5cf7ad081aee10e6c42d949c8bd7b", "ja": "だって美希先輩が大人になったらツアー連れてって\nくれるって！　ねーいいじゃないですかー。", "zh": "可是美希前辈说过，等她长大了就会带我去巡演！对吧——不是很好嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1024_406gsp", "source_sha256": "03140f680f9a3e154ba6bd5a7089ee42ca785775adb2e17838c066268515b2fb", "ja": "…………翼。", "zh": "…………翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1025_406gsp", "source_sha256": "ce379be83d1d2b886b723e7be0c97c070b9b144befb7e5bdb1cdce333cf75dcf", "ja": "打ち上げ行くか！　何か食べたいものあるか！？", "zh": "要不要去吃庆功宴！有没有想吃的东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "513d35b5a7eb26814b4d1772bc82e4f4a604464865b9186804e1ba761b0ba7e9", "ja": "ハイ！　わたし、お肉がいいです！", "zh": "好！我想吃肉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1027_406gsp", "source_sha256": "caea0a393463f6b178a2249e4f67d9a5cbcc3b454dc85aca30f9e5746aaeb39f", "ja": "……よし！　肉だ！　全員準備しろ！", "zh": "……好！吃肉！全员准备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1028_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1029_null", "source_sha256": "3386360bf00815c274eb723e951119754210820e93182f2d396bc67cb9d4a40c", "ja": "―音楽イベント『新宿バンドフェス』　当日―", "zh": "——音乐活动“新宿乐队节”　当天——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "4edca2fd4ad658bd9a3c1ae64b6e6775bbc52caa34610f80acf480a8c391e3ef", "ja": "さーて。いよいよバンドフェスに、アイドルが\n殴り込みだ。翼、ミズキ、覚悟はいいか？", "zh": "那么，终于轮到偶像闯进乐队音乐节了。翼、瑞希，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8579929f8ffdd27b608482140b5e520979a3bc2f73d87c3d4246f6f4b0f21902", "ja": "はーい♪　今日はノドの調子もいいし、\nパーッと歌ってみんなで盛り上がりたい気分でーす♪", "zh": "好呀♪今天嗓子的状态也很好，想痛痛快快地唱一场，和大家一起嗨起来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "1492e470699132029b6a529cd175dcca94d625459cb3fa2c289c50bc66e0acb0", "ja": "私はいつも1曲目で迷うタイプですが、今日はセトリが\n決まっているので、迷いはありません。……キリッ。", "zh": "我属于总会在第1首歌上犹豫的类型，不过今天的歌单已经定好了，所以不会犹豫。……一脸严肃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "c03504afcd209aa11e9ca2b80148d57c3ff539dcba3293e0b1ba0b6c6caeee10", "ja": "だからカラオケじゃないっつーの！\n……はあ。ま、リラックスしててなによりだ。", "zh": "所以都说了不是卡拉OK啦！\n……唉。算了，你能放松下来就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_06_1034_staff", "source_sha256": "b2b39967d1168f4dde75720a017c942a9c4154af2b2d160dbef152fd5e823225", "ja": "765プロさん、準備お願いします！", "zh": "765事务所，请做好准备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
